The dashboard must show: onboarding state, scan status, file count, workstream count, approved sources count, selected audiences, last audit time, inference card count, contradiction count, risk count, repair count, top risks, and primary CTA. CTA should be \'93Continue onboarding,\'94 \'93Approve sources,\'94 \'93Select audiences,\'94 \'93Run audit,\'94 or \'93View report,\'94 depending on state.\
No dead buttons. No placeholder cards. No fake data unless demo mode is explicitly enabled and labeled. If a feature is disabled due to missing API key, show missing-key state. If disabled because not implemented, say not implemented in debug/admin only, but do not put broken controls in user path.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

